\name{vacttmle-package}
\alias{vacttmle-package}
\alias{vacttmle}
\title{Visit-aligned continuous-time TMLE}
\description{
Standalone implementation of visit-aligned continuous-time TMLE for scheduled
visit trials with composite time-to-event endpoints. The current package targets
composite-event-free survival, \eqn{P(T^d > \tau, D^d > \tau)}.
}
\details{
The intercurrent event \eqn{D} is part of the composite endpoint in this package
version. Hypothetical no-\eqn{D} or no-switch estimands are not exposed.
}
